        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Brave Adventurer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/0509945885c584cc715d98bff142bda5.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simplistic Inventory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inventory is simple a minimalistic for easy overview over your things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/f595e221a6d9ab8f44eaa7c537a8f7b4.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1226 height=682 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the classes you chose, It will determine how you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/bfb6f28cb907c9540ccab453e29a441e.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though at the moment you can only chose one class which is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Knight</strong></i><strong></strong><br>Pick up a sword and some armor and fight your way through with might, honor and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/52c4b9b0a6243830b8a1c90b478546c6.avif?t=1759514777\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>More Classes to come in the future while I develop the game!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what the Little Brave Adventurer decided when he grew up he gains some different skills through out his journey that will help him survive, fight or prolong his capabilities.<br><br>Which means, when you chose a class you will get some specific skill outright, Like this skill here &quot;Pray&quot; Which heals you up by 50 HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/fcf062f99a4ef63e0c905fe0bc018895.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1244 height=634 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Little Brave Adventurer can go and gather different resources that will benefit himself, he can also do this while he is on his way fighting the different monsters ahead.<br><br>In short, as soon as you click gather, you will gather for 10 minutes and after that you will gain rewards that will benefit you which comes to the next point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/fbb0244a26392ad90331d8672ba88c3f.avif?t=1759514777\" width=798 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Little Brave Adventurer fights and gathers to his hearts content, he can take a breather and craft different types of weapons and armor so that he is better equipped to the fight to come.<br><br>Once selected which weapon and armor you make, they will be automatically equipped and it will boost your attack and defense. Which would make it easier to fight the monsters that is there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/f6bd69e0f31c71bbb3474357e0a2160a.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1184 height=642 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary / Exotic Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Legendary / Exotic weapons and armors out there but in order to get them, they have to face a terrible foe multiple times to be able to craft such items. Be sure to be properly equipped before facing this foe.<br><br>These two weapons are examples on what you need in order to be able to craft them.<br>You would need to fight the boss multiple times in order to get enough materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/2994d98bb0fb09eaf10c5ffe31337109.avif?t=1759514777\" width=256 height=216 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/79eaa79320d17f3f51c824ea4ffc197f.avif?t=1759514777\" width=258 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Brave Adventurer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/0509945885c584cc715d98bff142bda5.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simplistic Inventory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inventory is simple a minimalistic for easy overview over your things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/f595e221a6d9ab8f44eaa7c537a8f7b4.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1226 height=682 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the classes you chose, It will determine how you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/bfb6f28cb907c9540ccab453e29a441e.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though at the moment you can only chose one class which is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Knight</strong></i><strong></strong><br>Pick up a sword and some armor and fight your way through with might, honor and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/52c4b9b0a6243830b8a1c90b478546c6.avif?t=1759514777\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>More Classes to come in the future while I develop the game!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what the Little Brave Adventurer decided when he grew up he gains some different skills through out his journey that will help him survive, fight or prolong his capabilities.<br><br>Which means, when you chose a class you will get some specific skill outright, Like this skill here &quot;Pray&quot; Which heals you up by 50 HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/fcf062f99a4ef63e0c905fe0bc018895.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1244 height=634 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Little Brave Adventurer can go and gather different resources that will benefit himself, he can also do this while he is on his way fighting the different monsters ahead.<br><br>In short, as soon as you click gather, you will gather for 10 minutes and after that you will gain rewards that will benefit you which comes to the next point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/fbb0244a26392ad90331d8672ba88c3f.avif?t=1759514777\" width=798 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Little Brave Adventurer fights and gathers to his hearts content, he can take a breather and craft different types of weapons and armor so that he is better equipped to the fight to come.<br><br>Once selected which weapon and armor you make, they will be automatically equipped and it will boost your attack and defense. Which would make it easier to fight the monsters that is there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/f6bd69e0f31c71bbb3474357e0a2160a.avif?t=1759514777\" width=1184 height=642 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary / Exotic Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Legendary / Exotic weapons and armors out there but in order to get them, they have to face a terrible foe multiple times to be able to craft such items. Be sure to be properly equipped before facing this foe.<br><br>These two weapons are examples on what you need in order to be able to craft them.<br>You would need to fight the boss multiple times in order to get enough materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/2994d98bb0fb09eaf10c5ffe31337109.avif?t=1759514777\" width=256 height=216 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997430/extras/79eaa79320d17f3f51c824ea4ffc197f.avif?t=1759514777\" width=258 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
